### Bug fixes

* Skip creating `~/.conda` in shell installers when `register_envs` is false.
  Avoids a spurious failure when `$HOME` is read-only. (#1215)
* Export `MAMBA_ROOT_PREFIX="$PREFIX"` in shell installers so micromamba does
  not attempt to access `$HOME/micromamba` at startup. (#1215)
* Export `MAMBA_NO_RC=1` in shell installers so libmamba does not load
  `$HOME/.mambarc` / `$HOME/.condarc` during install. (#1215)

